rce":"https://idahocapitalsun.com/2023/02/27/after-longwinded-debate-idaho-senate-kills-controversial-education-savings-account-bill/","author":["[[Sadie Dittenber]]"],"published":"2023-02-27","created":"2026-07-10","description":"This story was originally posted on IdahoEdNews.org on Feb. 27, 2023. A divisive education savings account (ESA) bill died in the Idaho Senate on Monday afternoon — in a 12-23 vote that came after over two hours of floor debate. Senate Bill 1038 would have established a universal education savings account program, providing $5,950 scholarships […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},